	(text "RC TIMER\nFORMULA:\n  t = τ × ln(V_CC / (V_CC − V_T+)),  τ = R × C\nDATA:\n  V_CC = 4.94 V, V_T+ = 2.60 V (74HC14)\n  t = 485 ms (right, below 500 ms), C = 1 µF\nRESOLUTION:\n  t = τ × ln(4.94 / 2.34) = 0.75 × τ\n  τ = 0.485 s / 0.75 = 0.65 s\n  R = τ / C = 0.65 s / 1 µF = 650 kΩ → 649 kΩ\n"
